59. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Data S1 Click here for additional data file. (168.4KB, pdf)',96,'2025-10-03 07:53:54','2025-10-03 07:53:54');
