meta-analysis. Lancet. 2016;388(10057):2272–2281. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 40. Busireddy KR, Miller JA, Ellison K, Ren V, Qayyum R, Panda M. Efficacy of Interventions to Reduce Resident Physician Burnout: A Systematic Review. J Grad Med Educ. 2017;9(3):294–301. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 41. Govindan M, Keefer P, Sturza J, Stephens MR, Malas N. Empowering Residents to Process Distressing Events: A Debriefing Workshop. MedEdPORTAL. 2019;15:10809. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 42. McDermott A, Brook I, Ben-Isaac E. Peer-Debriefing After Distressing Patient Care Events: A Workshop for Pediatric Residents. MedEdPORTAL. 2017;13:10624. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 43. Weiss AK, Quinn SM, Danley AL, Wiens KJ, Mehta JJ. Burnout and Perceptions of Stigma and Help-Seeking Behavior Among Pediatric Fellows. Pediatrics. 2021;148(4). [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 44. Perry H, Naud S, Fishman MDC, Slanetz PJ. Longitudinal Resilience and Burnout in Radiology Residents. J Am Coll Radiol. 2021;18(5):639–646. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 45. McMahon CJ, Tretter JT, Redington AN, et al. Medical education and training within congenital cardiology: current global status and future directions in a post COVID-19 world. Cardiol Young. 2022;32(2):185–197. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Supp Table NIHMS2009011-supplement-Supp_Table.pdf (178KB, pdf)',2369,'2025-10-03 08:00:46','2025-10-03 08:00:46');
INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(154,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6057581','[Accidents in patients under anticoagulant therapy in the Department of Cardiology at the Yalgado Ouedraogo Teaching Hospital, Ouagadougou (Burkina Faso)].','Millogo GRC, Kologo JK, Kinda G, Yaméogo NV, Tougma JB, Kambiré Y, Thiam AT, Sanon B, Toguyeni JY, Samadoulougou A, Zabsonré P.','2018','etudier hemorragie agi visee allant decembre yalgado presentant hemorragie infarctus myocarde pourvoyeur hemorragies heparines poids moleculaire hbpm agissait hemorragie majeure neuf hemorragie mineure semaines semaines saignement tractus digestif associe antiagregant plaquettaire arret definitif constituait hemorragique quatre deces inaccessibilite protamine ppsd prothrombine proconvertine veritable frein meilleure utilisateur drogues constituerait preventions evitables hemorragie thrombose veineuse yalgado ouagadougou heparins inaccessibility protamine ppsd proconvertine haemophilia cardiovasculaires monde augmente affections thromboemboliques occupent angulaire responsables negligeables iatrogenie developpes indiques curatif secondaire thromboembolique veineuse vitamines prescrits allongement esperance thrombotiques connait essor ampleur paru opportun mener yalgado entrepris yalgado ouagadougou allant decembre visee traites heparine hemorragie hemorragie fiche collecte utilisee comportait anthropometriques anciennete traitements associes parametres biologiques essentiellement hemoglobine plaquettes creatininemie renseignements saignement entrepris arret sanguine remplissage vasculaire saisies analysees logiciel definie hemorragie majeure toute hemorragie fatale intracranienne peritoneale necessite sanguine surdosage regroupait toutes toute hemorragique neuf foyer concernees residaient ville ouagadougou rurale residait ville hemorragie retrouve origine alcoolique tabagisme hormonale diabete antiagregant plaquettaire thrombose intracardiaque victimes hemorragique pourvoyeur hemorragies heparines